---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="FTC disclosure for SoftenerIndex affiliate /go placeholder links."
  canonicalPath="/disclosure"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker">Advertising</p>
      <h1>FTC disclosure</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        SoftenerIndex uses stable <code>/go/...</code> paths for partner links. Those paths are
        placeholders until a destination is configured.
      </p>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you follow a live <code>/go</code> hop and
        later buy from that partner, SoftenerIndex may receive a commission. That commission does
        not change the editorial rule: we still do not invent hardness, installer, or price
        numbers, and we do not let a partner’s pitch replace a public water-quality report or a
        license lookup.
      </p>
      <p>
        Placeholder hops (status <code>placeholder</code> in affiliate frontmatter) do not
        redirect. They exist so URLs can be published in guides before a contract is live. When a
        hop is marked <code>live</code>, the page will send you to the partner destination and the
        link will be marked <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code> from in-content calls to action.
      </p>
      <p>
        This disclosure is provided in the spirit of the Federal Trade Commission’s Endorsement
        Guides: material connections should be clear. The banner on every page, this page, and
        the labeled <code>/go</code> CTAs are the notice.
      </p>
      <h2>Current /go paths</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/go/water-test-kit">/go/water-test-kit</a></li>
        <li><a href="/go/local-installer-match">/go/local-installer-match</a></li>
        <li><a href="/go/salt-delivery">/go/salt-delivery</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
